WEBVTT

01:47.560 --> 01:48.800
My car's packed.

01:48.920 --> 01:49.840
Just sit in front.

01:50.240 --> 01:51.120
Fine, thanks.

01:51.720 --> 01:53.080
Here, dry your hair with some tissue.

01:55.720 --> 01:56.520
Hainan?

01:57.440 --> 01:57.880
Yeah.

01:58.039 --> 01:59.400
I just got back from a business there.

02:04.080 --> 02:05.240
Quanya, got an umbrella?

02:05.920 --> 02:06.440
Bring me one.

02:06.560 --> 02:07.120
Let me see.

02:07.240 --> 02:07.720
Yeah.

02:10.639 --> 02:11.440
heading out, Wu?

02:12.320 --> 02:12.960
To pick someone up.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.400
Pretty handsome, isn't he?

02:31.360 --> 02:32.160
You know him?

02:34.240 --> 02:35.280
He's my cousin.

02:36.040 --> 02:37.000
You cousin?

02:41.200 --> 02:42.200
You're Shu Han, right?

02:43.800 --> 02:44.840
How do you know me?

02:46.680 --> 02:48.560
You'd just come back from Hainan,

02:49.000 --> 02:50.079
and I heard from Xing Wu

02:50.560 --> 02:51.360
that he has a friend

02:51.520 --> 02:52.520
who happened to be there on business.

02:53.120 --> 02:54.720
A lot of people go to Hainan.

02:56.960 --> 02:58.040
I've also been to Shunyi,

02:59.000 --> 02:59.840
and seen your photo.

03:00.840 --> 03:01.440
Quanya

03:01.560 --> 03:02.800
put your photo on the wall.

03:03.040 --> 03:03.720
His phone wallpaper

03:03.720 --> 03:04.520
is also a picture of you two.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.280
So basically,

03:06.280 --> 03:07.640
you recognized me just now,

03:07.800 --> 03:09.040
and that's why you got in my car, right?

03:10.080 --> 03:10.560
Right.

03:11.280 --> 03:12.000
Xing Wu said,

03:12.520 --> 03:13.800
girls in Zhazhating got to

03:13.880 --> 03:14.920
keep an eye out for something.

03:15.680 --> 03:16.920
I gotta say,

03:17.120 --> 03:18.280
girls in anywhere got to

03:18.640 --> 03:19.600
keep an eye out for anything.

03:23.720 --> 03:24.640
Could you please get my

03:24.640 --> 03:25.520
Bluetooth earbuds for me?

03:25.520 --> 03:26.800
Just right in the glove box before you.

03:27.000 --> 03:27.760
-Sure
-Just right in there.

03:36.000 --> 03:36.520
Thanks.

03:40.120 --> 03:40.680
Hello?

03:41.480 --> 03:42.280
Mr. Jiang.

03:42.360 --> 03:43.640
Long time no see.

03:43.920 --> 03:44.680
That project of yours,

03:44.680 --> 03:45.840
I've already sent it to Mr. Ye.

03:45.840 --> 03:47.040
He's looking, and considering.

03:47.480 --> 03:48.280
Don't worry.

03:48.320 --> 03:49.400
Once there's any progress,

03:49.400 --> 03:51.440
I'll contact you right away.

03:51.720 --> 03:52.360
Sure, sure, sure.

03:52.360 --> 03:52.960
Bye-bye.

03:56.320 --> 03:57.240
Talking about a tens of millions

03:57.240 --> 03:58.760
project with pocket change.

03:59.320 --> 04:00.640
How's that any different from a toad

04:00.640 --> 04:01.520
wishing to eat a swan*?
[*Chinese slang]

04:03.000 --> 04:04.080
You scratched all

04:04.320 --> 04:05.120
these lottery tickets?

04:05.280 --> 04:05.800
Yeah.

04:06.320 --> 04:07.360
I buy whenever I'm free.

04:07.560 --> 04:09.000
Work's usually crazy busy.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.480
Non-stop business trips,

04:10.680 --> 04:11.400
meetings,

04:11.440 --> 04:12.240
making PPTs.

04:12.960 --> 04:14.240
Scratching lottery tickets

04:14.280 --> 04:15.480
brings a little bit of surprise

04:15.520 --> 04:16.600
and something to look forward to

04:17.000 --> 04:17.920
in my life

04:20.120 --> 04:21.480
So that's what it is.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.240
You didn't actually buy that, did you?

04:26.360 --> 04:27.840
Everything I just said

04:27.840 --> 04:29.000
was just an excuse

04:29.000 --> 04:29.720
for never winning.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.040
Quite frankly,

04:31.320 --> 04:32.480
money talks to me.

04:32.680 --> 04:33.600
I wanna make a fortune.

04:33.640 --> 04:34.800
I wanna strike it rich overnight.

04:34.960 --> 04:35.520
Honestly, I wish

04:35.520 --> 04:36.840
the rain falling from the sky

04:36.840 --> 04:37.480
was money.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.040
On this point,

04:39.600 --> 04:40.760
I guess we see eye to eye.

04:44.280 --> 04:45.360
So, have you ever won big?

04:45.960 --> 04:46.760
Not at all.

04:47.240 --> 04:48.640
I've only ever won some small.

04:48.640 --> 04:50.400
Like 10 or 20 yuan.

04:50.680 --> 04:51.840
Oh, the most I ever won

04:52.000 --> 04:53.280
was only around 500 yuan.

04:54.040 --> 04:54.760
But it's fine.

04:55.040 --> 04:55.840
I don't ask for much

04:56.159 --> 04:56.920
as long as I still win some.

04:58.120 --> 04:58.960
I've heard that

04:59.480 --> 05:01.440
the odds of winning this kind of lottery

05:01.800 --> 05:03.680
are about 1 in 20 million.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.520
Which means, it would take you 2,7000 years

05:05.800 --> 05:08.000
even if you buy 2 tickets every single day.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.080
2,7000?

05:09.080 --> 05:10.200
But look on the bright side.

05:10.520 --> 05:11.680
After losing this

05:11.680 --> 05:12.560
many times,

05:12.960 --> 05:14.560
the odds of you winning next time

05:15.040 --> 05:15.760
have got to be

05:15.840 --> 05:17.080
better than before.

05:19.080 --> 05:20.360
Xing Wu told me

05:20.560 --> 05:22.200
that you're a city girl.

05:22.280 --> 05:23.840
and you might have trouble adapting here.

05:24.960 --> 05:25.840
I'm telling you

05:26.480 --> 05:27.480
he underestimated you.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.360
What else did Xing Wu say about me?

05:31.680 --> 05:32.520
Not much.

05:33.159 --> 05:34.720
He said you're a distant relative of him,

05:34.960 --> 05:36.320
whom he hadn't been in touch with for years.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.440
And you came over here because of

05:38.640 --> 05:39.640
some recent family troubles.

05:40.920 --> 05:41.440
That's true.

05:42.280 --> 05:43.080
If something hadn't

05:43.080 --> 05:44.320
happened at home,

05:44.800 --> 05:45.800
I wouldn't even have known

05:46.159 --> 05:47.720
I had a distant cousin.

05:52.000 --> 05:52.960
Did Xing Wu...

05:53.320 --> 05:54.680
ever mention me?

05:56.760 --> 05:58.360
I heard from Kyle and Big G

05:58.920 --> 05:59.800
that you're my sister-in-law.

06:01.800 --> 06:02.560
Those two

06:02.560 --> 06:04.160
just can never say anything good.

06:04.160 --> 06:04.960
They love to crack jokes.

06:04.960 --> 06:05.840
I'm totally get used to them.

06:07.120 --> 06:07.840
What about you?

06:08.360 --> 06:09.520
What do you think of Xing Wu?

06:09.760 --> 06:10.840
I like him, huh.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.160
I think Xing Wu's a good guy,

06:13.400 --> 06:14.800
reliable, and capable.

06:54.920 --> 06:55.520
Qing Ye?

06:56.240 --> 06:56.800
What are you...

06:59.760 --> 07:00.600
The rain is insane.

07:00.920 --> 07:01.600
Xing Wu!

07:06.040 --> 07:06.640
The rain...

07:07.840 --> 07:08.840
Ye is back!

07:08.840 --> 07:09.480
Auntie.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.280
- Look at you
- Take a look,

07:10.280 --> 07:11.040
You're soaked!

07:11.360 --> 07:12.520
This is all set. What do you think?

07:14.280 --> 07:15.640
Wow, distinguished!

07:15.880 --> 07:16.520
It looks great!

07:18.080 --> 07:18.720
Ye,

07:19.160 --> 07:20.080
thank you so much.

07:20.440 --> 07:21.720
If it weren't for you,

07:21.720 --> 07:22.520
we wouldn't even know

07:22.520 --> 07:24.120
that we had to shoot these whatever flyers.

07:24.280 --> 07:25.320
It looks way better than the ones I got done

07:25.320 --> 07:26.480
at the photo studio.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.600
I gotta post this on my Moments.

07:28.720 --> 07:29.080
Yeah.

07:29.120 --> 07:30.640
Perfect chance to promote Xuan Island, too.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.560
Yes, yes.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.600
That's just what I was thinking.

07:33.920 --> 07:34.800
Auntie Fang!

07:35.440 --> 07:36.240
Auntie Fang, Shu Han!

07:36.240 --> 07:37.040
Come on, give me a hand!

07:37.080 --> 07:37.840
It's pouring out there!

07:38.040 --> 07:39.040
Here, here, oh my gosh...

07:39.320 --> 07:39.840
The rain is just crazy.

07:39.840 --> 07:40.360
Here, give it to me.

07:40.400 --> 07:41.440
Why'd you bring all this?

07:41.440 --> 07:42.960
Just come all this way.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.480
The rain's really coming down.

07:44.520 --> 07:45.200
It really is.

07:45.280 --> 07:46.240
Where's Nanna?

07:46.480 --> 07:47.920
Nanna? Nanna just went to sleep.

07:48.159 --> 07:49.680
Well, since I just got back from Hainan,

07:49.680 --> 07:50.840
I brought you all some

07:50.840 --> 07:51.560
local specialties.

07:51.920 --> 07:53.159
There's palatable coconut candy,

07:53.159 --> 07:54.280
and some useful coconut oil.

07:54.400 --> 07:55.400
You love looking your best,

07:56.120 --> 07:57.520
so it's perfect for you.

07:57.520 --> 07:58.920
Thank you! You are so sweet.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.360
And I should thank you

08:00.400 --> 08:01.360
on Nanna's behalf, too.

08:01.440 --> 08:02.080
That's not all!

08:02.120 --> 08:03.280
I also brought dried coconut,

08:03.320 --> 08:04.000
chili sauce,

08:04.480 --> 08:06.360
and a ton of fruit in the back seat.

08:06.480 --> 08:07.000
Xing Wu.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.080
More in the back seat.

08:08.200 --> 08:09.040
Okay. I'll get it.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.560
Hey! Take an umbrella.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.640
Right, don't get soaked.

08:11.960 --> 08:12.640
Don't get caught in the rain!

08:12.760 --> 08:13.120
Take a rest.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.000
It's really pouring outside.

08:14.000 --> 08:14.920
Let me show you something.

08:15.000 --> 08:15.600
Let me show off.

08:15.800 --> 08:17.240
Look what we just shot for Xuan Island.

08:17.720 --> 08:19.520
So pretty!

08:20.040 --> 08:20.920
I knew it.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.120
With good genes like yours, Auntie,

08:22.120 --> 08:23.000
of course Xing Wu

08:23.000 --> 08:23.920
turned out so handsome.

08:25.360 --> 08:26.760
You sweet-talker.

08:27.040 --> 08:27.800
Wu,

08:28.120 --> 08:29.280
Shu Han just said

08:29.560 --> 08:31.080
it's because of my good genes

08:31.080 --> 08:33.080
that I have such a handsome son.

08:33.760 --> 08:34.960
That's because her brother took a good photo.

08:35.919 --> 08:37.280
My... My brother took it?

08:37.360 --> 08:38.520
Yeah, Quanya took it.

08:38.640 --> 08:39.360
I'm telling you,

08:39.360 --> 08:40.440
Quanya the kid actually

08:40.440 --> 08:41.720
has quite a talent.

08:42.919 --> 08:44.920
Not bad for this guy.

08:45.320 --> 08:47.000
But it's mainly because you're good-looking.

08:48.240 --> 08:49.840
Well, we do look good.

09:14.800 --> 09:15.520
Any problem?

09:19.520 --> 09:20.360
Have some warm water.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.440
Your hair is wet. Dry it off.

09:47.200 --> 09:48.200
Go look after your guest.

09:48.800 --> 09:49.520
I'm fine.

10:01.640 --> 10:02.240
Give it to me.

10:02.880 --> 10:03.720
What are you doing?

10:03.800 --> 10:05.200
Just pressing on wet paper won't work.

10:05.920 --> 10:07.160
You gotta put it in the freezer for a bit.

10:08.320 --> 10:09.840
Where'd you hear that nonsense?

10:10.560 --> 10:11.520
The bookstore owner taught me.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.520
These two are way too soaked.

10:14.760 --> 10:15.320
Just throw them out.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.600
No way, no way, no way.

10:16.920 --> 10:18.400
They cost 5 mao each.

10:18.800 --> 10:20.000
Two of them make a whole yuan.

10:21.600 --> 10:22.720
You weren't like this a month ago.

10:23.920 --> 10:25.240
Things are different now.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.440
The entire finances of Xuan Island

10:27.440 --> 10:28.360
are in my hands right now.

10:29.240 --> 10:30.560
It's not easy being the finance minister.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.040
Don't worry.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.240
I'll fix them for you.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.200
Don't forget to drink the warm water.

11:06.160 --> 11:06.640
Here.

11:07.400 --> 11:08.080
Take a look.

11:13.840 --> 11:14.760
Impressive.

11:15.240 --> 11:16.200
It looks exactly the same.

11:16.760 --> 11:17.720
This job's tough.

11:17.920 --> 11:18.920
I had to look up much info

11:19.040 --> 11:20.120
and work overtime to make it.

11:20.920 --> 11:21.440
Many thanks.

11:21.920 --> 11:22.560
I'll have Mr. Ye

11:22.560 --> 11:23.400
transfer the money as soon as possible.

11:23.880 --> 11:24.880
I should be thanking you.

11:24.960 --> 11:26.160
You keep sending work my way.

11:26.840 --> 11:28.360
Then I hook you up with another job?

11:28.480 --> 11:29.040
Interested?

11:29.480 --> 11:29.920
Sure.

11:30.280 --> 11:31.480
There's money to make, why not?

11:31.920 --> 11:32.600
It's in Xinhai.

11:32.960 --> 11:34.120
A week-long business trip at least.

11:34.680 --> 11:35.440
Xinhai?

11:36.520 --> 11:38.040
A batch of computer towers over there,

11:38.240 --> 11:39.600
about 200 units,

11:39.920 --> 11:42.880
need to be taken apart, serviced, refurbished.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.080
200 units?

11:45.360 --> 11:46.360
That's no small job.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.200
A big workload

11:48.440 --> 11:49.520
A bigger payout.

11:50.680 --> 11:51.160
How much?

11:51.920 --> 11:52.800
Agree to one condition,

11:52.800 --> 11:53.520
and I'll tell you.

11:54.960 --> 11:55.600
Tell me first.

11:56.160 --> 11:56.640
Come.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.360
sit.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.600
This time,

12:02.960 --> 12:03.920
we're not doing a 20-80 split.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.120
We're doing 30-70.

12:06.440 --> 12:07.000
Okay.

12:07.840 --> 12:08.800
Wow, you're pretty easygoing.

12:09.240 --> 12:11.040
Aren't you worried I'll get greedy

12:11.080 --> 12:12.520
and push my luck to ask for more next time?

12:13.040 --> 12:14.000
What choice do I have?

12:14.080 --> 12:14.960
I still have to count on you to

12:14.960 --> 12:15.800
find me work in the future.

12:17.920 --> 12:18.440
Deal.

12:19.360 --> 12:19.920
Deal.

12:21.840 --> 12:23.040
But I gotta make this clear first,

12:23.080 --> 12:23.840
there's a good reason

12:23.840 --> 12:24.920
I'm asking for more this time.

12:24.960 --> 12:26.200
That wasn't easy to negotiate

12:26.200 --> 12:27.080
this pay,

12:27.080 --> 12:28.400
and it's this much this time!

12:29.440 --> 12:30.080
Not bad, huh.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.520
So asking for 30% isn't too much, right?

12:33.440 --> 12:34.080
That's fair.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.680
What do you think of Xing Wu?

12:36.280 --> 12:37.320
I like him, huh.

12:37.520 --> 12:39.160
I think Xing Wu's a good guy,

12:39.400 --> 12:40.720
reliable, and capable.

12:44.600 --> 12:45.840
Plus, I won't let you down.

12:48.120 --> 12:48.720
What is this?

12:49.920 --> 12:50.800
Go get some relaxation.

12:51.360 --> 12:52.480
Just think of it as an employee perk

12:52.480 --> 12:53.920
for your third year working at Xuan Island.

12:55.000 --> 12:55.720
An amusement park?

12:56.240 --> 12:57.200
Mr. Ye invested it

12:57.200 --> 12:58.080
a few years ago.

12:58.240 --> 12:59.440
It's reviews are great.

12:59.920 --> 13:00.400
I can set you up

13:00.400 --> 13:01.640
with the full package

13:01.680 --> 13:03.040
— meals, lodging, and transport.

13:05.760 --> 13:06.920
It's a nice place, sure.

13:07.200 --> 13:08.040
But I don't have time.

13:08.760 --> 13:10.000
Hey, I arranged it just for you,

13:10.000 --> 13:10.720
and you're not going?

13:11.960 --> 13:12.920
That's very kind of you,

13:13.280 --> 13:14.240
but I'm good.

13:15.920 --> 13:16.840
Won't you reconsider?

13:18.560 --> 13:20.280
Xuan Island brings in business these days.

13:20.400 --> 13:21.920
Qing Ye asked me to help her hand out flyers.

13:24.520 --> 13:25.000
Fine.

13:27.520 --> 13:28.120
Take this,

13:28.400 --> 13:29.160
you shall go with Quanya.

13:29.640 --> 13:30.720
I'll help you load these into the car.

13:51.520 --> 13:52.200
Wu.

13:53.080 --> 13:53.840
Where's Shu Han?

13:54.680 --> 13:55.800
I'm here, Auntie.

13:56.480 --> 13:57.480
Oh, Shu Han,

13:57.480 --> 13:59.000
it's good to see you came back.

13:59.320 --> 14:01.280
The moment you returned, my sun came out.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.280
The moment you returned,

14:02.280 --> 14:02.720
my son

14:02.720 --> 14:03.720
finally has work to do.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.520
You're really a fortune cat* for our family.
[*Chinese figurine symbolizing wealth]

14:06.920 --> 14:07.600
A lucky cat.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.640
Come on, Auntie.

14:10.840 --> 14:12.440
Wu is actually my fortune god.

14:12.560 --> 14:13.960
We make money together.

14:14.000 --> 14:14.520
It's great.

14:14.840 --> 14:16.200
Exactly, exactly.

14:16.280 --> 14:17.600
Making money, money.

14:17.920 --> 14:20.440
Fortune cat and fortune god are well matched.

14:21.760 --> 14:22.520
In your eyes,

14:22.560 --> 14:23.560
Zhao Pock and Joey Wong

14:23.560 --> 14:24.240
are a perfect match, too.

14:24.760 --> 14:25.640
They are well matched, yeah.

14:25.840 --> 14:26.600
but Zhao Pock

14:26.600 --> 14:27.480
can't get Joey Wong.

14:27.480 --> 14:28.320
So what can I do?

14:29.080 --> 14:30.160
Look, Shuhan's back.

14:30.160 --> 14:31.360
Shouldn't you hurry up and

14:31.400 --> 14:33.160
treat her to a welcome-back dinner?

14:33.640 --> 14:34.160
Fine.

14:35.240 --> 14:36.280
Let's invite Qing Ye along too.

14:40.040 --> 14:41.320
Well, then it has to be my treat.

14:41.600 --> 14:43.160
As the host, I should welcome my cousin.

14:43.600 --> 14:44.160
Qing Ye,

14:44.400 --> 14:45.640
what kind of food are you into?

14:47.160 --> 14:48.280
Well, I don't really

14:48.600 --> 14:49.680
have an appetite, so...

14:49.720 --> 14:50.280
and I need to sort out the flyers.

14:50.280 --> 14:50.960
Who caught your eye, huh?

14:52.040 --> 14:52.840
Be serious.

14:54.800 --> 14:55.440
No appetite

14:55.440 --> 14:56.640
exactly means you shall go out for some good.

14:57.240 --> 14:58.160
Exactly.

14:58.680 --> 14:59.320
How about this

14:59.520 --> 15:00.920
— we go to Granny Zhao's café

15:00.920 --> 15:01.600
for some dessert.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.000
I happen to have brought her some

15:03.000 --> 15:03.920
coffee beans from Hainan.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.000
How about it?

15:07.040 --> 15:07.560
Fine.

15:07.840 --> 15:08.920
I gotta thank my sister-in-law.

15:11.560 --> 15:12.320
Don't say that nonsense.

15:14.040 --> 15:14.800
You little brat...

15:15.720 --> 15:16.400
Let's go, go.

15:19.920 --> 15:20.360
Go.

15:24.520 --> 15:25.040
Ye.

15:26.920 --> 15:27.400
Um,

15:28.280 --> 15:29.560
I still have

15:29.760 --> 15:30.560
200 yuan.

15:30.760 --> 15:31.280
Take it,

15:32.000 --> 15:33.760
and keep an eye on Wu for me in a bit.

15:34.040 --> 15:35.160
Don't let the girl pay.

15:37.240 --> 15:37.800
I get it.

15:38.720 --> 15:39.200
Go on.

15:45.960 --> 15:47.160
Ah, to be young.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.760
Tofu for sale!

15:51.720 --> 15:54.080
Freshly made tofu!

15:54.760 --> 15:55.640
Thank you, Granny.

15:56.000 --> 15:56.600
Here, let me.

15:56.720 --> 15:58.280
Thanks, Granny. This's for Qing Ye.

15:58.600 --> 16:00.200
Here, This's yours.

16:00.200 --> 16:00.680
Okay.

16:01.120 --> 16:01.800
This one's yours.

16:01.800 --> 16:02.920
Thank you, Granny Zhao.

16:03.360 --> 16:03.920
Hey, Granny.

16:04.240 --> 16:04.800
Well, I

16:04.840 --> 16:06.520
brought you beans from Hainan.

16:07.360 --> 16:08.520
Try them later.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.640
If they're good,

16:09.640 --> 16:10.440
just let me know.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.200
I'll bring you more next time.

16:11.960 --> 16:13.000
Thank you so much.

16:13.600 --> 16:14.680
It's all thanks to you always bringing me

16:14.680 --> 16:15.640
such good beans.

16:15.720 --> 16:16.520
It's nothing.

16:17.040 --> 16:19.160
These are the best coffee and

16:19.600 --> 16:20.320
desserts in our shop.

16:20.480 --> 16:22.000
Today, it's my treat!

16:22.280 --> 16:22.960
Hey, no way.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.000
It's my treat, my treat.

16:24.200 --> 16:24.920
Grandma Zhao,

16:25.320 --> 16:26.680
This looks absolutely beautiful.

16:27.160 --> 16:28.760
Who did you learn to make coffee from?

16:29.280 --> 16:30.360
I learned it from my son.

16:30.920 --> 16:32.480
After my son graduated from college,

16:32.760 --> 16:34.240
he wanted to open a café

16:34.440 --> 16:36.160
here in Zhazhating.

16:36.720 --> 16:37.680
But who around there

16:37.720 --> 16:39.200
even has a taste for coffee?

16:39.520 --> 16:40.200
They all said

16:40.360 --> 16:41.920
it tasted like herbal medicine.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.760
So, he gave up

16:43.800 --> 16:44.920
and went to work in the city.

16:44.960 --> 16:45.840
But with all this equipment,

16:45.840 --> 16:46.920
I couldn't just let it sit idle.

16:47.560 --> 16:48.400
So I started

16:48.400 --> 16:49.360
learning it from him.

16:50.000 --> 16:51.000
It smells so good.

16:51.200 --> 16:52.000
You're really amazing.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.520
Well, as people say,

16:54.920 --> 16:57.520
tea drinkers talk about the past,

16:58.240 --> 17:00.240
while coffee drinkers talk about the future.

17:00.360 --> 17:00.800
See?

17:01.120 --> 17:01.920
It's drawn all of you

17:01.920 --> 17:02.760
young people here.

17:03.920 --> 17:05.200
Alright, take your time and enjoy.

17:05.280 --> 17:06.319
Call me if you need anything.

17:06.480 --> 17:07.160
We'll do, thanks Granny.

17:07.319 --> 17:07.839
Thank you, Granny.

17:07.960 --> 17:09.119
Leave it to Granny Zhao,

17:09.280 --> 17:10.560
she can really match your Nanna.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.520
They chat whenever they're free.

17:12.599 --> 17:13.079
See,

17:13.359 --> 17:14.440
Granny Zhao knows that

17:14.680 --> 17:15.520
I can't stand pour-over.

17:16.920 --> 17:17.800
You know what,

17:18.400 --> 17:20.359
Granny Zhao's coffee-making skills

17:20.359 --> 17:20.960
are really good.

17:21.359 --> 17:22.720
It's just as good as the ones in Beijing.

17:24.000 --> 17:25.319
I've stayed in Beijing before too.

17:25.520 --> 17:26.040
Really?

17:26.440 --> 17:26.960
Yeah!

17:27.160 --> 17:28.359
I stayed there for a while back then.

17:28.720 --> 17:30.200
Then coming here now,

17:30.320 --> 17:31.440
was it hard to get used to?

17:32.680 --> 17:34.200
I wasn't used to it at first.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.040
But later I found out,

17:36.480 --> 17:37.400
These big local cherries give

17:37.600 --> 17:38.640
aren't any worse than imported ones.

17:39.520 --> 17:40.160
Jujube cake

17:40.360 --> 17:42.040
can easily replace cheesecake.

17:42.640 --> 17:44.360
And those patterned buns

17:44.440 --> 17:45.440
can be a substitute for bagels.

17:45.720 --> 17:46.920
But don't you still miss

17:46.920 --> 17:48.120
the authentic originals sometimes?

17:49.920 --> 17:51.160
I used to fancy cheesecake

17:51.160 --> 17:52.000
very much.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.240
I wanted to eat it every single day.

17:53.440 --> 17:54.400
But now I know,

17:54.680 --> 17:55.920
I can live without it.

17:56.160 --> 17:57.840
I'm super adaptable to new environments.

17:58.520 --> 18:00.920
I've evolved a "Zhazha stomach".

18:01.200 --> 18:02.000
Zhazha stomach?

18:02.440 --> 18:03.440
Is that really a thing?

18:03.560 --> 18:04.080
Let me try.

18:10.920 --> 18:12.240
How's it any different from herbal medicine?

18:14.800 --> 18:16.440
Come on, what do you know?

18:17.920 --> 18:18.720
Have this sweet

18:18.720 --> 18:19.800
and shut your mouth up.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.560
I'll just stick to my instant coffee.

18:25.400 --> 18:26.000
Qing Ye,

18:26.280 --> 18:27.560
you're Xing Wu's cousin.

18:27.600 --> 18:28.600
How come I've never seen you

18:28.600 --> 18:29.400
in Zhazhating before?

18:30.760 --> 18:32.200
My mom said I came here once

18:32.200 --> 18:32.920
when I was really little.

18:33.120 --> 18:34.440
After that, we were probably too busy,

18:34.520 --> 18:35.240
so we never came back.

18:35.720 --> 18:37.040
What kind of relatives are you guys?

18:37.200 --> 18:38.560
No matter what, relatives

18:38.560 --> 18:40.240
should still visit each other, huh?

18:41.080 --> 18:42.280
We aren't related by blood.

18:55.600 --> 18:56.440
Well...I see.

19:04.120 --> 19:04.600
Qing Ye,

19:05.240 --> 19:05.840
Fancy a drink?

19:06.600 --> 19:07.960
Granny Zhao has her own homemade liquor.

19:12.160 --> 19:13.720
Well, I'd better not.

19:14.640 --> 19:16.440
It's fine! It's not very strong.

19:16.480 --> 19:17.200
It won't hit you hard.

19:17.680 --> 19:18.280
Forget it.

19:18.560 --> 19:19.200
She doesn't drink.

19:19.240 --> 19:19.760
What?

19:19.920 --> 19:20.960
She's not an adult?

19:21.080 --> 19:21.600
I am!

19:21.800 --> 19:22.760
She's an adult,

19:23.360 --> 19:24.200
but his tolerance isn't.

19:26.720 --> 19:27.640
If she's not drinking,

19:27.920 --> 19:28.520
will you?

19:28.640 --> 19:29.280
I won't.

19:29.360 --> 19:30.560
I gotta work overtime at Shunyi tonight.

19:36.480 --> 19:37.320
Hello, Dr. Zhuang.

19:39.320 --> 19:40.040
It's broken again?

19:40.680 --> 19:41.320
Is it urgent?

19:42.040 --> 19:43.320
Okay, okay.

19:44.080 --> 19:44.680
I'll go, I'll go.

19:46.840 --> 19:47.960
I just don't get it.

19:48.680 --> 19:50.200
Why do they always come to you

19:50.360 --> 19:51.560
to fix things right before dark?

19:51.920 --> 19:52.640
This is the peak hour for

19:52.640 --> 19:53.640
using electrical appliances.

19:53.760 --> 19:55.160
Dr. Zhuang's TV is broken.

19:55.320 --> 19:56.280
He said today's the finale.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.560
I'll be right back.

20:01.920 --> 20:02.520
Shu Han,

20:03.280 --> 20:04.920
he's gone, let's drink a little.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.200
Good.

20:30.320 --> 20:31.920
We've started drinking. Hurry up.

20:32.840 --> 20:33.680
Don't let her drink too much.

20:38.360 --> 20:39.160
Many thanks, Wu.

20:39.920 --> 20:40.920
Have some water, here.

20:41.680 --> 20:42.520
Thanks, Dr. Zhuang.

20:43.600 --> 20:44.240
So, how is it?

20:44.600 --> 20:45.440
Is it a major problem?

20:48.160 --> 20:48.960
It's minor, actually.

20:49.800 --> 20:50.680
So that means I can

20:50.680 --> 20:51.840
watch the finale, right?

20:52.160 --> 20:52.680
Don't worry.

20:53.040 --> 20:53.840
I'll definitely make sure

20:53.840 --> 20:54.600
you watch the finale today.

20:55.240 --> 20:56.160
That's great.

20:56.480 --> 20:58.160
I was so worried I'd miss it.

20:59.760 --> 21:00.440
How much?

21:01.640 --> 21:02.920
Forget about the money.

21:02.960 --> 21:03.520
No charge.

21:04.160 --> 21:04.920
My Grandma said,

21:05.280 --> 21:06.440
last time she came you for medicated patching

21:06.440 --> 21:07.480
and you only charged her for the labor.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.760
Th...This old lady.

21:09.360 --> 21:10.600
Still couldn't fool her.

21:10.680 --> 21:11.520
Such expensive medicine,

21:11.760 --> 21:13.000
and you only charged 10 yuan.

21:13.600 --> 21:14.640
Only a fool would believe it.

21:16.200 --> 21:18.120
I just wanna save you some money.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.560
We're all neighbors here.

21:20.200 --> 21:21.040
No need to be so polite.

21:21.800 --> 21:22.520
Business's business.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.360
She doesn't like owing people favors.

21:24.640 --> 21:25.240
Neither do I.

21:25.520 --> 21:26.240
We're even now, huh.

21:26.720 --> 21:28.320
Fine, have it your way then.

21:29.920 --> 21:31.040
The two of you

21:31.480 --> 21:32.280
— cut from the same cloth.

21:32.800 --> 21:33.640
In your hearts,

21:34.080 --> 21:35.240
each of you is sharper than the other.

21:36.760 --> 21:37.280
You rest up

21:37.440 --> 21:38.200
I'll call you when it's fixed.

21:38.360 --> 21:38.760
Good.

21:39.040 --> 21:39.920
I...I've still got medicine

21:39.920 --> 21:40.600
brewing out back.

21:40.800 --> 21:41.400
You go ahead.

21:51.080 --> 21:51.680
[Don't worry.]

21:56.920 --> 21:57.440
[Girl,]

21:57.520 --> 21:58.120
[you really start drinking]

21:58.120 --> 21:59.400
[with your sister-in-law?]

21:59.440 --> 22:00.720
[Why didn't you call me over?]

22:00.840 --> 22:02.280
[When we girls drink,]

22:02.480 --> 22:03.080
[how are we supposed]

22:03.240 --> 22:04.240
[to have girl talk if you're here?]

22:04.400 --> 22:05.680
[Kyle, stop shouting nonsense.]

22:05.800 --> 22:06.920
[You're making me sound old.]

22:07.280 --> 22:09.000
[You two became besties so quickly?]

22:09.280 --> 22:09.920
[My goodness.]

22:09.920 --> 22:11.320
[Sisters-in-law? Soul sisters!]

22:12.280 --> 22:14.040
[Don't forget to hand out flyers tomorrow.]

22:17.120 --> 22:17.560
Come on.

22:19.720 --> 22:20.560
Great.

22:21.760 --> 22:22.200
Cheers.

22:22.360 --> 22:22.840
Cheers.

22:27.240 --> 22:28.040
You really have no idea.

22:28.160 --> 22:29.560
Xing Wu used to be even busier.

22:30.080 --> 22:31.560
Every time, he'd get a bite of a meal,

22:31.600 --> 22:32.360
then someone would call him away.

22:32.560 --> 22:33.920
He'd back after helping out, eat a bite,

22:33.960 --> 22:34.800
then get called out again.

22:35.200 --> 22:35.920
By the end of the day,

22:35.920 --> 22:36.920
he couldn't even finish a single meal.

22:37.000 --> 22:37.720
It would turn completely cold.

22:38.360 --> 22:39.120
Shu Han,

22:39.680 --> 22:40.760
did you and Xing Wu

22:40.840 --> 22:41.920
grow up together?

22:42.440 --> 22:43.080
No.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.920
We've known each other for about

22:45.000 --> 22:45.600
2 years.

22:46.840 --> 22:47.440
2 years?

22:48.920 --> 22:49.840
I've heard from Auntie

22:49.920 --> 22:51.480
that Xing Wu left school

22:51.640 --> 22:52.480
2 years ago

22:52.680 --> 22:53.760
and went to work at Xuanyi.

22:54.400 --> 22:55.160
That's when you met,

22:55.160 --> 22:55.760
right?

22:57.400 --> 22:59.200
My brother got a fever when he was a kid,

22:59.560 --> 23:01.080
which affected his hearing.

23:01.360 --> 23:02.000
He later kept

23:02.000 --> 23:03.280
wearing a hearing aid all the time, right?

23:03.920 --> 23:05.080
So it's harder for him

23:05.120 --> 23:06.760
to find a job compared to other people.

23:07.520 --> 23:09.200
He's loved tinkering with electronics

23:09.200 --> 23:09.960
since he was a kid,

23:10.320 --> 23:11.760
so I set up a repair shop for him.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.560
That way he could make a living,

23:13.680 --> 23:14.480
and do something

23:14.480 --> 23:15.840
he actually interested in.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.120
Back then,

23:18.240 --> 23:19.440
the Second Bridge was a mess.

23:19.640 --> 23:20.440
There was a thug

23:20.480 --> 23:22.040
who saw how young we siblings were

23:22.440 --> 23:23.600
and came to cause trouble every day.

23:23.920 --> 23:25.160
Just then, Xing Wu came by

23:25.160 --> 23:25.960
looking for work.

23:26.000 --> 23:26.960
Without saying a word,

23:26.960 --> 23:27.640
he chased them off

23:27.680 --> 23:28.520
and protected us.

23:31.200 --> 23:31.920
Yeah.

23:32.040 --> 23:33.160
Someone like Xing Wu,

23:33.520 --> 23:35.360
usually looks quiet and reserved,

23:35.800 --> 23:37.240
but he's quite fierce when he fights.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.520
Exactly.

23:38.960 --> 23:41.120
He's just a man of few words,

23:41.600 --> 23:42.800
keeping silent usually.

23:42.960 --> 23:44.120
But whatever he promises you,

23:44.280 --> 23:45.080
he'll definitely do.

23:46.720 --> 23:47.920
I lost my parents early.

23:48.480 --> 23:49.920
For us siblings, meeting Xing Wu

23:49.920 --> 23:50.840
felt like

23:51.400 --> 23:52.360
gaining another family member.

23:56.120 --> 23:57.280
It's the same for me.

23:58.800 --> 23:59.720
This year,

23:59.760 --> 24:01.360
Shunyi has basically been

24:01.360 --> 24:02.840
protected by Xing Wu.

24:03.320 --> 24:03.840
He's

24:04.200 --> 24:05.560
capable, does great works,

24:05.600 --> 24:06.280
always responds to requests.

24:06.320 --> 24:07.560
He's earned me a lot of money.

24:07.720 --> 24:08.600
And He and I are great

24:08.600 --> 24:09.240
business partners.

24:09.920 --> 24:11.080
Just business partners?

24:11.480 --> 24:12.120
What else?

24:14.440 --> 24:15.120
I...

24:17.600 --> 24:19.040
I see that Kyle

24:19.040 --> 24:20.280
and Auntie both think

24:20.680 --> 24:21.560
you two are a couple.

24:22.120 --> 24:23.120
They say that every single day.

24:23.120 --> 24:24.160
I've gotten used to them.

24:25.920 --> 24:26.920
What about Xing Wu?

24:27.360 --> 24:28.120
What does he think?

24:30.400 --> 24:31.920
What Xing Wu thinks...

24:32.720 --> 24:33.720
I've known it for a long time.

24:42.160 --> 24:42.920
Well, I...

24:43.560 --> 24:45.160
I feel like Xing Wu lives a very hard life.

24:45.840 --> 24:47.000
He became the backbone of his family

24:47.000 --> 24:48.160
at such an early age,

24:49.040 --> 24:50.040
He always puts other people's problems

24:50.040 --> 24:51.480
ahead of his own.

24:51.840 --> 24:53.000
He's out there every day grinding

24:53.000 --> 24:53.920
just to make a living.

24:58.760 --> 24:59.520
Qing Ye,

25:00.200 --> 25:01.280
could you do me a favor?

25:01.480 --> 25:02.320
What kind of favor?

25:03.000 --> 25:04.040
I should've thought of it sooner.

25:17.400 --> 25:18.200
Are you kidding me?

25:18.760 --> 25:19.520
Cheers! Cheers!

25:20.800 --> 25:21.680
Enough drinking, huh?

25:22.760 --> 25:23.400
It's already dark.

25:23.440 --> 25:24.720
Why're you only here now?

25:24.840 --> 25:25.720
Want a drink too?

25:25.960 --> 25:26.680
I'd better not.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.440
Hey, if you drink, how are you gonna drive

25:29.760 --> 25:31.040
I've already called Quanya.

25:31.080 --> 25:32.160
He'll be here to pick me up soon.

25:32.920 --> 25:33.440
Alright.

25:34.120 --> 25:35.480
Since we're almost done here,

25:35.760 --> 25:36.560
I'll go pay the bill.

25:38.760 --> 25:39.440
No, no, no.

25:40.080 --> 25:40.920
You're the one who has to pay.

25:41.120 --> 25:42.160
Auntie specifically told me to.

25:42.160 --> 25:42.680
Look.

25:42.840 --> 25:43.560
She gave me money.

25:43.560 --> 25:44.720
She said we can't let a girl pay the bill.

25:44.800 --> 25:45.400
It's fine.

25:45.440 --> 25:46.520
I'm not that picky about money with her.

25:46.520 --> 25:47.600
We earn it together anyway.

25:47.840 --> 25:49.280
What do you mean it's fine? You fool.

25:49.280 --> 25:50.160
Don't you understand

25:50.400 --> 25:52.240
what does it mean to not let a girl pay?

25:53.440 --> 25:54.320
I've already paid.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.040
Wait, Shu Han, we...

25:57.800 --> 25:59.360
we said we'd treat you,

25:59.360 --> 26:00.440
so we shall be paying.

26:00.440 --> 26:01.440
How could we let you pay?

26:01.760 --> 26:02.680
-You can treat me next time.
-Sis.

26:03.560 --> 26:04.000
Time to go.

26:04.440 --> 26:05.280
Quanya is here.

26:05.400 --> 26:05.920
I shall go.

26:06.080 --> 26:07.080
Remember our agreement.

26:09.600 --> 26:10.400
Qing Ye,  Wu.

26:10.720 --> 26:11.400
We're leaving.

26:11.440 --> 26:12.440
- Okay, bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

26:14.760 --> 26:15.240
Go.

26:16.560 --> 26:17.320
What agreement?

26:19.240 --> 26:19.920
None of your business.

26:22.000 --> 26:22.920
None of my business?

26:24.200 --> 26:24.920
Wait, wait.

26:25.480 --> 26:26.920
What were you two whispering about?

26:27.640 --> 26:28.600
So curious, huh?

26:31.280 --> 26:31.680
Huh, say it.

26:32.600 --> 26:33.760
Shu Han said,

26:34.000 --> 26:36.040
she introduced a new job to you.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.280
You need to go to Xinhai

26:37.280 --> 26:38.360
on a business trip for a while?

26:40.000 --> 26:40.520
Yeah.

26:42.080 --> 26:43.080
Making money's important,

26:43.800 --> 26:45.560
but, you still need to balance work and rest,

26:45.960 --> 26:47.760
Go out and relax a bit?

26:50.360 --> 26:51.360
Did she tell you about

26:51.840 --> 26:52.560
the amusement park?

26:54.920 --> 26:55.680
She even gave me the tickets.

26:57.520 --> 26:59.280
Don't worry, I'm at Xuan Island.

26:59.440 --> 27:00.160
For handing out flyers,

27:00.200 --> 27:01.840
Kyle and Big G could help.

27:02.200 --> 27:03.680
And Quanya will look after Shunyi.

27:04.200 --> 27:04.840
So you,

27:05.520 --> 27:06.120
just go.

27:06.640 --> 27:07.720
That place isn't for me.

27:07.760 --> 27:08.360
I never go there.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.920
That's why you should go!

27:10.000 --> 27:11.040
I'm not interested!

27:11.800 --> 27:12.680
Return the tickets to her.

27:14.640 --> 27:15.600
I haven finish yet.

27:17.640 --> 27:18.440
Going's not the point!

27:18.680 --> 27:20.000
The point's for the two of you to go together.

27:20.200 --> 27:21.520
What's there for me to do with her?

27:21.640 --> 27:22.440
If you want, go yourself.

27:23.400 --> 27:24.680
You think I don't want to go?

27:25.360 --> 27:27.400
But Shu Han gave these tickets for you,

27:27.520 --> 27:28.680
asking you to go.

27:28.920 --> 27:29.920
So the point itself

27:30.240 --> 27:30.960
is not going

27:31.000 --> 27:31.920
- but you two...
- Wait a second,

27:32.920 --> 27:34.240
What relationship do you think we have?

27:36.440 --> 27:38.080
Deeply connected partners, I guess.

27:38.800 --> 27:40.240
Besides, you're already this old

27:40.280 --> 27:41.320
and you don't even have a girlfriend.

27:41.360 --> 27:42.240
I saw Auntie's eyes

27:42.240 --> 27:42.960
light up today when

27:42.960 --> 27:44.000
she saw Shu Han.

27:44.080 --> 27:44.560
She couldn't wait

27:44.680 --> 27:46.080
for you to marry her into the family.

27:46.080 --> 27:46.680
You're thinking way too much.

27:46.760 --> 27:47.960
I'm thinking too much?

27:48.840 --> 27:50.600
I think Shu Han is actually pretty great.

27:50.680 --> 27:52.320
Fair-skinned, beautiful, with long legs,

27:52.360 --> 27:53.920
cool and generous.

27:53.960 --> 27:55.120
You could consider her.

27:55.160 --> 27:57.040
She's a good candidate for a girlfriend.

27:57.120 --> 27:58.400
Don't join them in making a fuss.

27:58.840 --> 27:59.720
What girlfriend and sister-in-law?

27:59.720 --> 28:00.440
See, getting flustered?

28:00.640 --> 28:01.480
And you still say you don't care about her?

28:01.480 --> 28:02.520
This is none of your business.

28:03.920 --> 28:05.200
It was never my business anyway.

28:05.200 --> 28:06.360
I don't even want to care.

28:27.000 --> 28:27.680
Auntie,

28:30.160 --> 28:32.080
Well, back to you.

28:34.920 --> 28:35.280
You...

28:35.600 --> 28:36.840
you didn't spend it?

28:38.080 --> 28:38.560
No.

28:40.840 --> 28:41.480
Did you drink?

28:44.440 --> 28:45.320
A little bit.

28:46.280 --> 28:46.960
Seriously,

28:47.240 --> 28:48.680
what was Wu thinking?

28:48.680 --> 28:50.400
How could he let a girl pay?

28:51.480 --> 28:52.160
I think so.

28:53.080 --> 28:53.920
But I don't know.

28:54.600 --> 28:56.040
You could ask him yourself, auntie.

29:00.240 --> 29:02.120
Such a tightwad, the kid.

29:35.080 --> 29:36.080
He's right, though.

29:37.040 --> 29:38.440
Whether he goes to the park

29:39.000 --> 29:39.920
is none of my business.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.200
How things are between Shu Han and him

29:43.080 --> 29:44.120
is even less of my business.

29:52.400 --> 29:53.280
About tonight,

29:53.960 --> 29:55.400
just pretend I was meddling.

29:56.240 --> 29:57.040
Don't misunderstand.

29:57.640 --> 29:59.000
I was never curious about you

29:59.000 --> 30:00.240
and Shu Han to begin with.

30:01.120 --> 30:02.440
I was just passing along the ticket.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.320
Whether you take it or not is up to you.

30:17.000 --> 30:18.680
So much for my good intentions.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.560
Did he not see it,

30:46.280 --> 30:47.640
or did he see it but ignore it on purpose?

30:50.160 --> 30:51.760
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.280
What's up?

31:02.160 --> 31:02.920
Ye?

31:03.320 --> 31:04.040
I'm coming in.

31:06.120 --> 31:08.000
How did the glass pane fall down?

31:08.720 --> 31:10.400
Are you okay? Didn't get hurt, right?

31:10.760 --> 31:11.440
I'm fine.

31:12.240 --> 31:12.720
Okay.

31:13.000 --> 31:13.640
Good to hear.

31:13.800 --> 31:14.760
Tomorrow I'll have Wu replace it with

31:14.760 --> 31:15.600
a new piece of glass.

31:15.960 --> 31:16.680
Don't move.

31:16.800 --> 31:17.360
I'll go downstairs

31:17.360 --> 31:18.440
to get a broom and sweep it up.

31:33.040 --> 31:33.640
You, come on.

31:33.920 --> 31:34.400
Alright.

31:38.800 --> 31:39.520
Come on, Wu.

31:43.320 --> 31:43.720
Come on.

31:43.760 --> 31:44.920
Nice one! Nice one!

31:45.200 --> 31:45.680
Keep going.

32:03.720 --> 32:04.480
Ta...Take it easy.

32:23.240 --> 32:24.200
I saw Auntie's eyes

32:24.200 --> 32:25.960
light up today when she saw Shu Han.

32:26.040 --> 32:26.480
She couldn't wait

32:26.640 --> 32:28.000
for you to marry her into the family.

32:28.000 --> 32:28.600
You're thinking way too much.

32:28.680 --> 32:29.920
I'm thinking too much?

32:30.280 --> 32:32.080
I think Shu Han is actually pretty great.

32:32.120 --> 32:33.760
Fair-skinned, beautiful, with long legs,

32:33.800 --> 32:35.360
cool and generous.

32:35.440 --> 32:36.560
You could consider her.

32:36.720 --> 32:38.560
She's a good candidate for a girlfriend.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.920
Don't join them in making a fuss.

32:40.320 --> 32:41.200
What girlfriend and sister-in-law?

32:41.200 --> 32:41.960
See, getting flustered?

32:42.080 --> 32:43.000
And you still say you don't care about her?

32:58.440 --> 32:59.000
I'm done!

32:59.120 --> 32:59.600
One more.

32:59.920 --> 33:00.800
-No more, no more.
-Wu,

33:01.040 --> 33:01.840
You want more?

33:02.120 --> 33:03.000
you'll lose your friends.

33:03.480 --> 33:04.280
Who the hell play with you,

33:04.280 --> 33:05.080
— you go nonstop.

33:18.960 --> 33:20.720
Cause it's so hard for you.

33:22.800 --> 33:24.120
My heart aches for you.

33:27.800 --> 33:29.560
If Xuan Island makes me

33:29.560 --> 33:31.280
tons and tons of money,

33:32.680 --> 33:33.800
would you

33:34.560 --> 33:37.920
not have to work so hard anymore?

34:21.560 --> 34:22.320
I've thought it through.

34:24.600 --> 34:25.400
I haven't thought it through.

34:25.600 --> 34:26.400
What did you think through?

34:27.400 --> 34:27.920
Wu.

34:28.639 --> 34:29.239
It,it...

34:30.120 --> 34:30.760
You two,

34:31.760 --> 34:32.400
never make jokes about

34:32.400 --> 34:33.600
Shu Han and me anymore.

34:38.800 --> 34:39.760
Could he actually have feelings

34:39.760 --> 34:40.400
for Shuhan?

34:40.800 --> 34:41.760
That's why he won't let us

34:41.760 --> 34:42.400
joke about her.

34:42.920 --> 34:43.520
It's possible,

34:43.840 --> 34:46.120
but it...doesn't seem like it.

34:47.360 --> 34:47.840
He's the one who

34:47.840 --> 34:48.760
called us over, right?

34:49.320 --> 34:49.760
Right!

35:12.560 --> 35:14.160
When I said none of your business was...

35:36.560 --> 35:38.280
Actually Shuhan and I aren't...

35:48.520 --> 35:49.920
I'll go hand out flyers with you tomorrow.

36:06.360 --> 36:08.160
Handing out flyers tomorrow morning.

36:13.400 --> 36:13.920
What time?

36:29.240 --> 36:30.520
Wu, what's going on?

36:30.920 --> 36:31.840
Why isn't she taking you with her

36:31.840 --> 36:32.560
to hand out flyers?

36:36.720 --> 36:37.720
I have to work tomorrow.

36:41.200 --> 36:42.000
No wonder.

36:42.480 --> 36:43.080
I thought so.

36:43.600 --> 36:44.600
Go to work and don't worry.

36:44.680 --> 36:45.400
You cousin has me.

37:00.840 --> 37:02.200
Please take a look. Thanks, thanks.

37:02.280 --> 37:02.800
Ma'am,

37:03.800 --> 37:05.040
Zhazhating Xuan Island Hair Salon.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.160
Hello, please take a look.

37:06.280 --> 37:06.760
Okay.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.920
Zhazhating Xuan Island Hair Salon.

37:08.000 --> 37:08.440
Ma'am.

37:09.040 --> 37:10.240
Zhazhating Xuan Island Hair Salon.

37:10.480 --> 37:11.360
Hello, please take a look.

37:11.560 --> 37:12.320
Zhazhating Hairdressing.

37:12.400 --> 37:13.640
Zhazhating Xuan Island's running a promotion.

37:13.680 --> 37:14.280
Check it out.

37:14.800 --> 37:15.200
Hello.

37:15.320 --> 37:16.600
Zhazhating Xuan Island's running a promotion.

37:16.800 --> 37:18.280
Zhazhating Xuan Island's running a promotion.

37:18.520 --> 37:19.520
Get a discount with this.

37:19.680 --> 37:21.000
Zhazhating Xuan Island's running a promotion.

37:21.320 --> 37:21.800
Hello.

37:21.840 --> 37:22.920
We're running a promotion.

37:22.920 --> 37:23.800
Zhazhating Hairdressing.

37:24.040 --> 37:24.520
Take a look.

37:24.520 --> 37:25.280
Zhazhating Hairdressing.

37:25.560 --> 37:26.040
Hello.

37:26.680 --> 37:27.120
Hello.

37:27.160 --> 37:27.920
Zhazhating Hairdressing.

37:28.160 --> 37:28.840
Just turn over there.

37:30.760 --> 37:31.240
Hello.

37:31.920 --> 37:33.200
Zhazhating Xuan Island's running a promotion.

37:33.280 --> 37:34.440
Check it out, there are discounts.

37:36.640 --> 37:37.560
Why you still have so many left?

37:37.760 --> 37:38.960
How come you only have one left?

37:39.600 --> 37:41.400
I...I'm charming, so I hand them out fast.

37:42.040 --> 37:43.520
How come it lose a piece?

37:44.560 --> 37:46.600
I...I saved that piece.

37:47.040 --> 37:47.920
Qing Ye said

37:48.240 --> 37:49.320
not a single one should be wasted.

37:49.520 --> 37:50.920
I'm not wasting it.

37:50.920 --> 37:51.960
I'm treasuring it.

37:52.040 --> 37:52.480
See?

37:53.360 --> 37:54.120
Just you wait.

37:54.320 --> 37:56.560
She'll surely kick your ass if she finds out.

37:56.800 --> 37:57.600
She kick my ass?

37:58.240 --> 38:00.000
I'd be more than happy!

38:00.440 --> 38:01.800
Girls are hardest on the ones they love.

38:02.200 --> 38:03.320
Then just help me hand out a few more.

38:03.640 --> 38:04.160
Just a few?

38:04.840 --> 38:05.280
Fine.

38:07.320 --> 38:07.760
A few.

38:12.000 --> 38:12.480
Bro,

38:12.800 --> 38:13.440
is this okay?

38:13.920 --> 38:15.120
If you can beat me,

38:15.280 --> 38:16.160
I'll let you post it.

38:17.240 --> 38:17.840
Thank you.

38:37.320 --> 38:38.320
Can I post it now?

38:38.680 --> 38:39.600
Go right ahead, feel free.

38:45.600 --> 38:46.200
Grandma,

38:46.400 --> 38:47.760
is this you in the photo?

38:47.920 --> 38:48.600
Yes, it is.

38:48.640 --> 38:50.000
Your perm looks really nice.

38:50.920 --> 38:51.760
Let me tell you,

38:52.040 --> 38:53.320
turn right out the door

38:53.480 --> 38:54.680
to Xuan Island Hair Salon.

38:54.960 --> 38:55.800
If you go get a perm,

38:55.920 --> 38:56.680
just tell them

38:56.840 --> 38:58.240
Grandma Zhou recommended you.

38:58.320 --> 38:59.280
You'll get a discount.

38:59.400 --> 39:00.640
Not bad, bro.

39:00.640 --> 39:01.360
You do this perm?

39:01.440 --> 39:01.920
Yeah.

39:02.560 --> 39:03.640
That's amazing.

39:03.680 --> 39:04.440
If anyone asks,

39:04.760 --> 39:05.960
remember to recommend Xuan Island for me.

39:06.120 --> 39:07.920
To be honest, the way you permed it...

39:08.440 --> 39:09.040
looks trendy.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.000
and great.

39:10.000 --> 39:10.400
Right, huh?

39:10.440 --> 39:11.000
Well, you...

39:11.000 --> 39:11.920
leave me a few more.

39:12.040 --> 39:12.680
Sure, I'll leave you plenty.

39:12.680 --> 39:13.240
I'll leave you plenty of them.

39:20.240 --> 39:21.120
Why are you posting it here?

39:22.920 --> 39:23.840
What are you doing here?

39:24.240 --> 39:25.320
Where I post it is none of your business.

39:25.600 --> 39:26.680
It won't be effective here.

39:26.800 --> 39:27.920
You should post it by the door,

39:28.080 --> 39:29.600
so people buying bubble tea can see it,

39:29.720 --> 39:30.920
and people passing by can see it too.

39:30.960 --> 39:31.920
The promotion will work much better.

39:32.240 --> 39:32.920
You think I'm fool?

39:33.160 --> 39:34.080
You think I didn't want to?

39:34.520 --> 39:35.600
The clerk wouldn't let me.

39:38.000 --> 39:38.720
They wouldn't let you?

39:40.800 --> 39:41.440
Let me try.

39:44.720 --> 39:45.200
Hello.

39:46.520 --> 39:47.160
Um...

39:51.600 --> 39:52.480
Okay, sure.

39:52.800 --> 39:53.520
Great, thank you.

40:06.000 --> 40:06.520
Here, eat

40:17.400 --> 40:19.080
Since I've bought, it'll melt if you don't.

40:22.120 --> 40:22.680
Their signature one.

40:25.440 --> 40:26.920
Fine, I'll do it for your sake.

40:31.360 --> 40:33.200
How did you get the clerk to agree

40:33.560 --> 40:34.680
to let me post it by the door?

40:35.920 --> 40:36.680
I told her

40:37.240 --> 40:37.840
I'd give her a bonus of

40:37.840 --> 40:38.680
thirty yuan a month.

40:40.120 --> 40:41.120
I thought it was something special.

40:41.640 --> 40:42.840
Turns out just the power of money.

40:43.680 --> 40:44.200
It's worth it.

40:44.400 --> 40:45.280
I noticed this shop before

40:45.280 --> 40:46.640
when I was installing their air conditioner.

40:47.160 --> 40:48.640
During peak hours, there are at least

40:48.680 --> 40:49.920
50 people per hour,

40:50.400 --> 40:51.480
and 30 even during off-peak hours.

40:51.560 --> 40:52.760
That means at least

40:52.760 --> 40:53.440
500 people a day

40:53.440 --> 40:54.520
will see our advertisement.

40:55.200 --> 40:56.560
Out of those 500 people,

40:56.560 --> 40:58.160
as long as 2 of them go to Xuan Island,

40:58.640 --> 40:59.480
we'll break even.

40:59.840 --> 41:00.280
Exactly.

41:00.400 --> 41:02.600
And we only have to cost 30 yuan

41:02.600 --> 41:03.240
for a whole month?

41:03.360 --> 41:04.440
Don't look down on the 30 yuan.

41:04.760 --> 41:05.800
30 yuan for those workers here

41:05.800 --> 41:06.680
can buy them

41:06.960 --> 41:08.200
2 boxed meals.

41:13.240 --> 41:14.120
How's the ice cream?

41:16.160 --> 41:17.560
Even though it's no Häagen-Dazs,

41:17.760 --> 41:19.240
it really is the shop's signature.

41:19.520 --> 41:20.720
It's already the best they have here.

41:21.920 --> 41:22.600
Not bad, yeah.

41:22.920 --> 41:24.120
Pretty milky.

41:24.360 --> 41:25.240
Not worse than Häagen-Dazs.

41:25.760 --> 41:26.640
I'll buy you another one.

41:26.920 --> 41:27.960
I haven't finished yet.

41:30.000 --> 41:30.520
What?

41:31.520 --> 41:32.160
You came here

41:32.560 --> 41:33.320
just to buy me

41:33.320 --> 41:34.120
ice cream?

41:42.920 --> 41:43.560
I came to apologize.

41:46.200 --> 41:47.080
Why are you apologizing to me?

41:49.120 --> 41:50.240
Yesterday I had a bad attitude.

41:50.760 --> 41:51.720
I shouldn't have spoken to you like that.

41:52.440 --> 41:53.160
Actually,

41:54.120 --> 41:55.680
I didn't mean it's none of your business.

41:56.240 --> 41:57.240
It's just that Shu Han and I

41:57.240 --> 41:58.360
really aren't what you think.

42:00.040 --> 42:01.080
You don't have to explain to me.

42:03.960 --> 42:04.760
Then why

42:05.080 --> 42:06.240
did you kick me out of the chat group?

42:06.920 --> 42:08.440
Cause I don't wanna bother such a busy man.

42:08.920 --> 42:09.920
How did you know I wouldn't come?

42:10.600 --> 42:11.800
Well, you know that yourself.

42:13.320 --> 42:15.080
Well,um...I saw the message.

42:15.920 --> 42:17.240
I didn't reply because

42:17.240 --> 42:18.040
I was busy with other things.

42:18.240 --> 42:19.280
I messaged you later,

42:19.280 --> 42:19.960
but you didn't reply either.

42:20.320 --> 42:20.840
That's because

42:20.840 --> 42:22.000
I've said everything I wanna say.

42:22.160 --> 42:23.160
And I think,

42:24.120 --> 42:25.320
what you said was right actually.

42:25.880 --> 42:26.440
You...

42:27.240 --> 42:28.480
have your own life there,

42:28.880 --> 42:30.000
and I shall not be

42:30.160 --> 42:31.680
poking into your life too much.

42:31.840 --> 42:32.960
I shall not have advised you

42:33.120 --> 42:34.400
on what to do or what not to do.

42:34.680 --> 42:36.120
Much less take it upon myself

42:36.520 --> 42:37.600
to pass tickets to you for someone else.

42:37.880 --> 42:38.320
No, it's...

42:38.960 --> 42:40.200
I know you meant well.

42:40.320 --> 42:41.600
But you didn't need

42:41.720 --> 42:42.160
right?

42:43.040 --> 42:43.680
So last night,

42:43.680 --> 42:44.640
I did some self-reflection, too.

42:45.600 --> 42:47.480
Since you all took me in at Xuan Island,

42:47.920 --> 42:48.960
I am very grateful,

42:49.520 --> 42:51.960
and maybe that made me overly enthusiastic.

42:55.360 --> 42:56.520
We're kind of family, right?

42:57.000 --> 42:57.600
Of course we are!

42:59.440 --> 43:00.560
But even among family,

43:00.920 --> 43:03.040
there's a sense of propriety and boundaries.

43:04.040 --> 43:04.680
Last night,

43:05.000 --> 43:05.960
I crossed the line.

43:06.280 --> 43:07.000
So from now on,

43:07.560 --> 43:09.360
I'll make sure to mind the boundaries

43:09.600 --> 43:10.400
and I won't interfere with you.

43:30.120 --> 43:31.480
Well, then.

43:31.840 --> 43:33.000
Let's put this matter

43:33.440 --> 43:34.200
behind us.

43:37.680 --> 43:38.680
This is your

43:38.720 --> 43:39.200
KPI for today.
